{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/MapError\/share()"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/MapError"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"share"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator is an alias for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"broadcast()"},{"text":", providing identical behavior.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/maperror\/share()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShareSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/S